WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.045
Deaf people have their own Name Signs

00:00:04.045 --> 00:00:06.214
so that we can identify you.

00:00:06.214 --> 00:00:09.676
It's based on who you are, what you do, what you're like.

00:00:09.676 --> 00:00:11.344
Name Signs are such an honor

00:00:11.344 --> 00:00:15.056
because you can only be given a Name Sign by a Deaf person.

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:16.349
And I was like...

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.852
I just like, kinda want someone to give me a Sign Name,

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.771
but I'm not gonna ask for it, 'cause that would be a little needy and annoying.

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:25.775
She was busy, running around and working.

00:00:25.775 --> 00:00:30.947
And our A.D. was walking by

00:00:30.947 --> 00:00:35.201
and they bonked heads so hard.

00:00:35.201 --> 00:00:39.205
Harder than I have ever bonked heads with anybody in my life.

00:00:39.205 --> 00:00:42.625
And Troy was like, "Even I heard that."

00:00:42.625 --> 00:00:46.463
So we gave her a nickname sign:

00:00:46.463 --> 00:00:47.922
* BONK *

00:00:47.922 --> 00:00:50.216
Look, there goes *Bonk*.

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:52.427
It was like two 'S's like, bonking together.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.637
And I was like: No! That can't be my Sign Name!

00:00:54.637 --> 00:00:56.848
I've been waiting for a Sign Name for all this time.

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:58.141
And now I'm like, "Bonk"?

00:00:58.141 --> 00:00:59.517
Like, for life I'm "Bonk"?

00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:02.353
But we gave her a more professional Sign Name:

00:01:02.353 --> 00:01:04.189
* S I Â N *

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:05.023
*Siân*

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:06.858
Which is the shine from her eye.

00:01:06.858 --> 00:01:09.152
Because her eyes are so intense and capture everything.

00:01:10.028 --> 00:01:11.071
It fits her perfectly.

